Package: yeastRNAdecayAnalysis
Title: Reproducible Analysis of Yeast RNA Decay During Glucose Adaptation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yasmine", "Benchekroun", email = "", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R workflow for analysing yeast SLAM-seq/RNA decay data, including DESeq2 differential expression, RNA half-life estimation, motif preparation, codon usage, and poly(A) tail comparisons.
